ive/2026-11-24-claim-ai-inspection-full-coverage/specs/claim/ai-inspection-full-coverage/spec.md":"0778e38719a0df4a6c7bf51b2357fe4eed8c53707ae4adba217c0fd23c4727f1","openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-24-claim-ai-inspection-full-coverage/tasks.md":"fef9536061ded3a82561ad135fbce8bca7b11d955d4c3786e2fdef6b359b681e","docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-24-claim-ai-inspection-full-coverage.md":"411ca7e64ac408eb967ced6018d68bf2dc5b20caaaa24d1bc5d249e7c16c5a56","openspec/specs/claim/ai-inspection-full-coverage/spec.md":"a8dda48fcc3a72b1426d12e54deb73629461a1a330b61ce7af2b43f1ebc45f0f"},"optionalFiles":{"openspec/changes/archive/2026-11-24-claim-ai-inspection-full-coverage/.comet-state.lock/.comet-runtime-migration.json":"b2cecf4a07f7b0dd762391b466a29fbf6bd16ee80c32f3619a1b060aa77d9640"},"recoveryApproval":{"proposalHash":"5e7641255eea984a73d18a3ebadfdb2c2ab4e1162f4e6c31d066b24aa0ddc851","changes":[{"path":"openspec/specs/claim/ai-inspection-full-coverage/spec.md","before":null,"after":"# claim/ai-inspection-full-coverage Specification\n\n## Purpose\n定义 100% AI 后督质检的可配置契约：抽样比例（含全量）、终态覆盖范围（含拒赔）、租户级开关与默认回落，使理赔结论的后督抽检在内部环境可判定、可证伪，且不触碰资金闸或赔付语义。\n\n## Requirements\n\n### Requirement: 全量抽样比例\n后督抽检比例 MUST 支持 0–100 的租户级配置；当比例配置为 100 时，系统 MUST 对该租户在抽检范围内的每一笔合格案件生成抽检记录，不得抽样遗漏。\n\n#### Scenario: 配置 100% 时全量命中\n- **WHEN** 租户 `INSPECTION_SAMPLING` 配置为 100，且存在 N 笔合格案件\n- **THEN** 系统对该 N 笔案件全部生成抽检记录，抽检数等于 N\n\n#### Scenario: 未配置时回落默认比例\n- **WHEN** 租户未配置 `INSPECTION_SAMPLING`\n- **THEN** 系统使用现网默认比例 5%，行为与本 change 之前完全一致\n\n### Requirement: 终态覆盖范围\n自动抽检的终态范围 MUST 覆盖自动通过结论与拒赔结论两类；当配置为 100% 时，两类终态的案件均 MUST 进入抽检，不得因终态类型被静默排除。\n\n#### Scenario: 拒赔终态纳入自动抽检\n- **WHEN** 一笔案件以拒赔终态完结，且抽检比例为 100\n- **THEN** 系统自动为该拒赔案件生成抽检记录，无需人工发起\n\n#### Scenario: 自动通过终态纳入自动抽检\n- **WHEN** 一笔案件以自动通过终态完结，且抽检比例为 100\n- **THEN** 系统自动为该案件生成抽检记录\n\n### Requirement: 租户隔离与配置口径\n抽检比例 MUST 按租户维度读取；一个租户的配置 MUST NOT 影响其他租户的抽检行为；配置读取失败时 MUST 回落默认比例并记录原因，不得中断主理赔流程。\n\n#### Scenario: 租户配置互不干扰\n- **WHEN** 租户 A 配置 100%、租户 B 未配置\n- **THEN** 租户 A 全量抽检，租户 B 使用默认 5%\n\n#### Scenario: 配置读取失败 fail-safe\n- **WHEN** 抽检配置读取失败\n- **THEN** 系统回落默认 5% 并记录诊断信息，主理赔流程不受影响\n\n### Requirement: 资金与语义边界\n本能力 MUST NOT 改变赔付金额计算、自动放款开关、视觉反诈桩可用状态或目录准入策略；抽检结果仅用于质检与人工复核，不得作为自动放款的触发条件。\n\n#### Scenario: 抽检不改变放款姿态\n- **WHEN** 抽检比例为 100 且某案件被抽检\n- **THEN** 该案件的放款状态与金额计算同抽检前一致，AUTO_APPROVE 与各 fail-closed 桩状态不变\n"}],"specs":{"openspec/specs/ai-governance-console/spec.md":"3031bc557ea65b0c67e4bac29dc9677b4431e4377b304defd178b3d385a76eef","openspec/specs/ai-native-readiness-criteria/spec.md":"3e961a5a371ec9089666a28bee1c06e3e5040f696ebbbb8c1f44e9878d698bbf","openspec/specs/claim/adjustment-strategy-parity/spec.md":"6848de76ce7dab6ba3b71b4cc30b3d958796a4af7f7172cd388359dd9e8f5f89","openspec/specs/claim/ai-calibration-flywheel/spec.md":"224c577f432ca8b6f6dea500cf32c8f0fa7e6c3abac5e4cdf114bdbd95670ec0","openspec/specs/claim/ai-config-governance/spec.md":"3bc6069e3ea3419d5307d78c01532de012f01d40359762c2c9afedbba1d807bb","openspec/specs/claim/ai-inspection-full-coverage/spec.md":"a8dda48fcc3a72b1426d12e54deb73629461a1a330b61ce7af2b43f1ebc45f0f","openspec/specs/claim/ai-knowledge-rag/spec.md":"9bf54340a1984996c6aea8f73736187a75f9867d599f5070f3e4501b236ea6ed","openspec/specs/claim/ai-native-readiness-governance/spec.md":"47fbb516230b89cd4be2fb79650d9700d8a75635bebba723353a69b294fd372c","openspec/specs/claim/ai-perception-image/spec.md":"d22e569d1be55a7457856d130e6aa92b0a044d6f1367034847ec0d5951141c47","openspec/specs/claim/biz-identity-registry/spec.md":"42986dce78b384f48225763bf29d3fdb9da2584f8e5da5409328e8e7f91e374c","openspec/specs/claim/case360-embedded-workflow/spec.md":"f29aa9934c8deacb9a86d9c3178dd4cf2ff348fe8738da70d13ff844375824c1","openspec/specs/claim/decision-graph-orchestration/spec.md":"8b1d6f882f54c4f9aa0f4f90fede7763b915ecf930fb7112771500c90c9e87b0","openspec/specs/claim/independent-re-review/spec.md":"40dfdf4f365dcb6614f5cecd6f5bd73dc4f43a3de72604107a36d5c42506eef9","openspec/specs/claim/inspection-handoff-timeout/spec.md